---
---

<header class="site-header">
  <nav class="nav">
    <a href="#" class="logo" aria-label="IndexLy inicio">
      <span class="logo-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2L3 7.5V16.5L12 22L21 16.5V7.5L12 2Z" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.95"/><path d="M12 22V11.5M3 7.5L12 11.5L21 7.5" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.4"/><circle cx="12" cy="11.5" r="2.2" fill="#a78bfa"/></svg>
      </span>
      <span class="logo-text">Index<span>Ly</span></span>
      <span class="logo-badge">beta</span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-actions">
      <a href="https://github.com/daidarzzz/indexly" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="nav-link">
        GitHub
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M7 17L17 7"/><path d="M8 7h9v9"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-badge">
    <span class="hero-dot"></span>
    Gestor de índices local & privado
  </div>
  <h1>Encuentra <em>todo</em> en segundos.</h1>
  <p>Carga tus JSON, combina múltiples fuentes y busca entre miles de juegos con un diseño pensado para la velocidad.</p>
</div>

<style>
  .site-header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 20;
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(160%);
    background: rgba(8,8,10,0.7);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }

  .nav {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 14px 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }

  .logo-mark {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1625, #211e36);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }

  .logo-text {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .logo-text span {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #c084fc);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .logo-badge {
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #a1a1aa;
    background: #1a1a1f;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .nav-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .nav-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-2);
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    transition: all 0.18s ease;
  }
  .nav-link:hover {
    color: var(--text-1);
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border-color: var(--border);
  }

  .hero {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 42px 20px 12px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-2);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    background: rgba(124,58,237,0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(124,58,237,0.18);
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .hero-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #22c55e;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(34,197,94,0.5);
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin: 18px 0 10px;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }

  .hero h1 em {
    font-style: normal;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6 0%, #a78bfa 55%, #ddd6fe 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .hero p {
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 520px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .nav { padding: 12px 16px; }
    .hero { padding: 28px 16px 8px; }
    .logo-badge { display: none; }
  }
</style>
